  "_about": "Raid autopilot playbook (SuiRaidPlaybook.cpp): per-raid and per-boss DATA on top of the generic autopilot. Lives beside mangosd.conf as sui-raid-playbook.json (this .dist is the fallback). Re-read when it changes; no restart. A boss is never pulled while a boss before it in its raid's order is alive.",
